This product reproduces observable formatting behaviour from OpenAI's Codex
(https://github.com/openai/codex), which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

The specific functions and the Codex source locations they mirror are named in
the doc comments of the modules that port them:

  - src/shared/format.ts   — compactAmount, countValue, formatDuration,
                             formatAbsoluteTime, and the helpers beside them
  - src/client/panel.tsx   — the analytics Overview layout

No Codex source code is copied or redistributed here. Only the observable
formatting rules — how a number is abbreviated, how a duration is rendered, how
the profile report is laid out — were reproduced, from the published source.
